cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MiniRes in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: MiniRes
abstract: >-
  A small, two-dimensional, two-phase (water/oil), immiscible reservoir
  simulator using two-point flux approximation (TPFA), with a hand-derived
  adjoint model. Intended for teaching, prototyping, and as a fast forward
  model for history matching and data assimilation experiments.
